GET {{baseUrl}}/oauth/me

::: auth oauth2
profile = sample-short

::: post
test("a new token from the password grant", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(200);
  expect(res.json().grant).toBe("password");
  expect(res.json().user).toBe("demo");
});

::: docs
`sample-short` asks for tokens that live 5 seconds, less than the 30 second margin, so the next
send finds it expired.
